OL,3,GNEWSA'Missing man' who left #12,000 of
OL,4,Aketamine in hotel gets unpaid work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who left a bag containing #12,500
OL,7,Fof drugs in a hotel storage room has
OL,8,Fbeen given 225 hours of unpaid work.
OL,10,FMichael Redmond, 42, checked the
OL,11,Fhold-all of ketamine into the Holiday
OL,12,FInn Express in Glasgow city centre on
OL,13,F28 April 2025.
OL,15,FGlasgow Sheriff Court heard how Redmond
OL,16,Fhad been reported as a missing person
OL,17,Fto police the previous day and was
OL,18,Fassessed as being "high risk."
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
