OL,3,GNEWSA'Missing man' who left #12,000 of
OL,4,Aketamine in hotel gets unpaid work
OL,5,
OL,6,FRedmond, of Ayr, pleaded guilty to
OL,7,Fbeing concerned in the supply of
OL,8,Fketamine and, in addition to the unpaid
OL,9,Fwork, was placed under supervision for
OL,10,Fone year.
